Project compatibility patch for content_moderation_notifications 3.9.
The 3.8 release intentionally removed all ad-hoc recipient access checks:
https://www.drupal.org/project/content_moderation_notifications/releases/8.x-3.8
This project explicitly retains its previous access policy and existing
bypass_anonymous_access values. This is NOT an unmerged upstream bug fix.
Based on the pre-3.8 behavior and the project's former #3419565 patch.
Apply after the content-type, token and Bcc-to-To patches. No config migration
is required: missing bypass values default to FALSE; existing values persist.
